290	// 8e-3 of its output (a host fp32 layer with only q/k/v rounded to fp16
291	// reproduces the device's whole error; every other fp16 operand costs it
292	// ≤3e-4, and every other layer teacher-forced is ≤1e-3). That error rides
293	// the residual's 5.8e3 outlier into every later layer: 3-7% rms on the
